{"id":3620669,"q":"Q3620669","imdb":"tt0078788","en":"Apocalypse Now Redux","orig":"Apocalypse Now Redux","ar":null,"tag":null,"ov":"فيلم أُصدر سنة 2001، من إخراج فرانسيس فورد كوبولا","plotEn":"Apocalypse Now Redux is a 2001 American extended version of Francis Ford Coppola's 1979 film Apocalypse Now. Coppola, along with editor and longtime collaborator Walter Murch, added 49 minutes of material that had been removed from the initial theatrical release. It is a significant re-edit of the original version. The cut premiered at the 2001 Cannes Film Festival on May 11, 2001 and was released on August 3, 2001 by Miramax Films.","rd":"2001-01-01","rt":202,"g":[18,28,27,12,10752,53],"lang":"en","budget":0,"revenue":0,"companies":[{"n":"American Zoetrope"}],"countries":["US"],"langs":[],"col":null,"rel":[],"dir":["Francis Ford Coppola"],"prod":[],"wri":["Francis Ford Coppola","John Milius","Michael Herr"],"mus":["Carmine Coppola"],"dop":["Vittorio Storaro"],"cast":[{"n":"Marlon Brando","ch":"Colonel Kurtz","p":null},{"n":"Robert Duvall","ch":"","p":null},{"n":"Martin Sheen","ch":"Benjamin L. Willard","p":null},{"n":"Frederic Forrest","ch":"","p":null},{"n":"Albert Hall","ch":"","p":null},{"n":"Sam Bottoms","ch":"","p":null},{"n":"Laurence Fishburne","ch":"","p":null},{"n":"Christian Marquand","ch":"","p":null},{"n":"Aurore Clément","ch":"","p":null},{"n":"Harrison Ford","ch":"","p":null},{"n":"Dennis Hopper","ch":"","p":null},{"n":"R. Lee Ermey","ch":"","p":null},{"n":"Colleen Camp","ch":"","p":null},{"n":"Colleen Camp","ch":"","p":null},{"n":"G. D. Spradlin","ch":"","p":null},{"n":"G. D. Spradlin","ch":"","p":null}],"wiki":{"en":"Apocalypse Now Redux","ar":null},"wk":1795623234133,"castOrder":["Marlon Brando","Robert Duvall","Martin Sheen","Frederic Forrest","Albert Hall","Sam Bottoms","Laurence Fishburne","Christian Marquand","Aurore Clément","Harrison Ford","Dennis Hopper"]}